  "title": "Maharashtra's Land Tokenisation Framework to Support Blockchain-Based Property Ownership",
  "summary": "Maharashtra will soon introduce a DELTA Act to enable the blockchain-based tokenisation of land and other immovable assets, as Chief Minister Devendra Fadnavis announced during a Global Fintech Fest event. This initiative aims to streamline property ownership and support the growth of fintech in the state.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The Maharashtra DELTA Act aims to create a legal framework for blockchain-based tokenisation of land and other immovable assets.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Fadnavis announced the legislation during a Global Fintech Fest 2026 event, highlighting its potential to support the state's fintech sector.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The Act is expected to simplify property ownership and enhance transparency.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
